window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p><b>This war of hearts will have no victor.</b></p> <p><b>Jaxon</b></p> <p>Messing with Logan Kent at a college rager is the perfect way to get under his skin. But when I steal my stepbrother's girl, it becomes a different ball game. Changing the play might be the dumbest thing I've ever done.</p> <p><b>Rya</b></p> <p>Kissing Jaxon Ledger to get over my best friend should solve all my problems. But when I discover they're rivals, our dynamic becomes complicated. Falling for stepbrothers might be the dumbest thing I've ever done.</p> <p><b>Logan</b></p> <p>Crushing on Rya Monroe is a secret I keep close to my chest. But when I see my best friend with the guy I love to hate, feelings get tangled. Craving them both might be the dumbest thing I've ever done.</p> <p><i>Welcome to Evermore University. This duet contains dark elements and situations that some listeners may be sensitive to. A complete list of content warnings can be found on the author's website.</i></p>"; 
